{"title":"2025 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Fast)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Fast)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Rigorous)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Rigorous)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_OmegaLearn.org\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by OmegaLearn.org</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_by_MadMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 by MadMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the set of all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/7/0f77ffe5a58ad635ffcaf6358678729bf9e07e75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> such that for all pairs of nonnegative integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/865509d6730d6b57a0dc2bac61a9f42ee4537aed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; y &lt; z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />, the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/8/cf8e65a784df08466daee1cfa89a46b8ce4a98e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is less than the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/5/5e5183a05ae6938c00c461aff3d297c72949ce5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"17\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. What is the sum of the elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/c/48c5d366fbe035403a06c4a6796b3b8bb9ff62b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}~3041 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}~3542 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}~3750 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}~4044 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}~4319$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"487\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> distinct remainders modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. However, if we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3eeefa367883375994fd2e1f575d088bce9d8b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" /> denote the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/8/cf8e65a784df08466daee1cfa89a46b8ce4a98e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we know that by the problem condition,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2af6f5ba208aade98fc5c1bfab625cb4f81f70c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[R(0)&lt;R(1)&lt;R(2)&lt;\\cdots&lt;R(z-1)\\]\" width=\"296\" height=\"18\" />\nBut there are only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> distinct remainders, and each of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> terms above must correspond to a distinct remainder, so we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cadd20df994ef01b81e12e271546a8493652eee7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(k)=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/8/3e872e1534c375a8ff911b6648b694855092929d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=0,1,\\dots,z-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0ba0fa4e51ad0f02e7208cf1a9ef9169e602ca85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025k\\equiv k\\pmod{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e3646fd6540cf61f4803f5f06a3b08412c036e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024k\\equiv 0\\pmod{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> can vary, this is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/cae856692bc35494135e8c6c1d7c0bf9eb95162a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024\\equiv 0\\pmod{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"144\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/4/2c4dcfb42214bbac64ef730ed4fa9905db00ed8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z\\mid 2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfy the property are the factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, so we simply need to find the sum of the factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> and subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> at the end since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/4/6b4818657d2a56eca0043d97d34bce69a55ef78b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z\\ne 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" />. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/2/582d3c4cab7a84c25880322cd63797b62210c8d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024=2^3\\cdot 11\\cdot 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"142\" height=\"17\" />, so the sum of the factors minus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae0f7d7de10212e964188e7d3953fe4b87fb7456.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1+2+4+8)(1+11)(1+23)-1=15\\cdot12\\cdot24-1=4320-1=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}~4319 }.\\]\" width=\"537\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Fast.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Fast)\">Solution 2 (Fast)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Fast)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0b05a912523abdad6249aa35ab96a6f91086f3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025x \\equiv x \\pmod{z} \\, \\forall z \\mid 2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"230\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/2/3c248ec35980d8822c2b1113b50c40258b98ff24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;y&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />, all pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> satisfy the remainder condition when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/4/2c4dcfb42214bbac64ef730ed4fa9905db00ed8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z\\mid 2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" /> except for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd3d68e77a39e1ea97e7009f70e12622fa76835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/3/a93522a0917906fb930cc8f0347deb40322413f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024=2^3\\cdot 11 \\cdot 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"142\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/0/e00a93a66efb91a4878076fa7d5d6b11e2b244c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum z=(15)(12)(24)-1=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}~4319}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"297\" height=\"31\" />, which is the largest answer choice.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Rigorous.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Rigorous)\">Solution 3 (Rigorous)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Rigorous)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will show that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />'s sastifying the statement are actually all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf27b25b0af3fcd6657702aeb9fe135ba6623994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aa21fc964e460d19ecd582010d0cb5a0cf95e8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5caadd690c6520e910452fa650db87411e6e356f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$($\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"6\" height=\"18\" />mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b422868a95d3e83770a3fe2d1ada8b24aa1bb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nWe first provide the construction. Let the remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f839410857b09119f93d997c74c925aca28cc02a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />. Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/b/83b9ee5caed87e7fec9369761fa6259c88020f2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\geq{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" /> in the following steps.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/1/c912675b47cfec9c49d248aba65143283c965dfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025x=px$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5caadd690c6520e910452fa650db87411e6e356f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$($\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"6\" height=\"18\" />mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b422868a95d3e83770a3fe2d1ada8b24aa1bb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/3/4839f5da57ae266b16cab350b526eceec96f9add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025y=py$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5caadd690c6520e910452fa650db87411e6e356f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$($\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"6\" height=\"18\" />mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b422868a95d3e83770a3fe2d1ada8b24aa1bb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThe aim of the construction is to make the the remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f28317251c3a682b197ecaf778ceed52bfdbc3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$px$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> upon division by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as large as possible, and to make the remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/a/18a8958c49b5a9baf6a159face6a419669f01f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$py$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> upon division by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as small as possible.\n</p><p><br />\n【The Construction】\n</p><p><br />\nSet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to be the largest positive integer satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/8/d6803c3298ccf6466720d6238f92c9af8ec9e494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$px&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p><br />\n【Proof of why the contruction works】\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56b8c9e754e4ef5761d0dae69d7d74ddce63217f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$py=p(x+1)\\geq{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNow calculate the remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/5/5e5183a05ae6938c00c461aff3d297c72949ce5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"17\" /> divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/9273a4b454450983ec18340603949652e6fff008.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x+1)=px+p\\leq{2px}&lt;2z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"237\" height=\"20\" />, so the remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/0/d7094232c8034e6eb5c2dc073439bf787167fa79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" /> upon division by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/b/32b7e5433fe32249e567432430d2f68365b65594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x+1)-z=px+p-z&lt;px$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"249\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThe remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/8/cf8e65a784df08466daee1cfa89a46b8ce4a98e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f28317251c3a682b197ecaf778ceed52bfdbc3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$px$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />, while the remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/5/5e5183a05ae6938c00c461aff3d297c72949ce5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"17\" /> divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f28317251c3a682b197ecaf778ceed52bfdbc3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$px$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />. This is a success in finding a counterexample, but we have to ensure that this pair of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> satisfies the condition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/2/3c248ec35980d8822c2b1113b50c40258b98ff24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;y&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/8/d6803c3298ccf6466720d6238f92c9af8ec9e494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$px&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/d/9bd29e202726726bff439cb92eb718d4a92a7843.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;\\frac{z}{p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/8895c72669df197a2e1dba283c777e41f3136e6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;\\frac{z}{p}+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"80\" height=\"38\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/d/b2d499e1b44f8cd6f7004f55a2d6618b9e35e65c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\geq{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abd1a0f0f317bdbce2ba1bbd491c96e494adb27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;\\frac{z}{2}+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e13ef2ecd3bf291217bd739180cb56ce9f7e57d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;\\frac{z}{2}+1&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"114\" height=\"34\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/6/e26a60d63c562032c4bc6c96a0d53a1cb921d793.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z\\geq{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/6/5e6dc42bb0d892a136cd56c48b13585b42428825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=2$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, a simple manual check of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> works as this is the only possible pair.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>This explains why the construction fails when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/9910fc8ed8a58c9874860c7482132fb871b8c502.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/9910fc8ed8a58c9874860c7482132fb871b8c502.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/8/66835779a3843bf54b5efa95473f8e7f44895221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=z-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/636739c8201322993086908b20be3eceb4a7854d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"11\" />, but the condition requires <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/392ab3f4df13f0dc32e7d1028d0c523ac409df65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nIn fact, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/9910fc8ed8a58c9874860c7482132fb871b8c502.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/3785bac8cd36632c3bac32eba2754d207aff31bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025x=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5caadd690c6520e910452fa650db87411e6e356f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$($\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"6\" height=\"18\" />mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b422868a95d3e83770a3fe2d1ada8b24aa1bb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59dcc94829e17d8e7e78f8c4615856f061e898d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025y=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5caadd690c6520e910452fa650db87411e6e356f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$($\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"6\" height=\"18\" />mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b422868a95d3e83770a3fe2d1ada8b24aa1bb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" />. The remainders are simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> themselves, the problem statement is automatically true for any pair of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4aee29876af28821f3a35178c09561adaf5a4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nFor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/9/d3954d6d1ba0896ad0277fcb976ff6f2c981c843.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/6/5963aeb7371b50bc58c606c15675293dc20e4367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025x=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5caadd690c6520e910452fa650db87411e6e356f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$($\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"6\" height=\"18\" />mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b422868a95d3e83770a3fe2d1ada8b24aa1bb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/6/4064b2fd74063350b354b1d5e9d16a7e48673b5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5caadd690c6520e910452fa650db87411e6e356f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$($\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"6\" height=\"18\" />mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b422868a95d3e83770a3fe2d1ada8b24aa1bb81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" />. The statement is always false because both remainders are always <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>In the end, we identify and add all the possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> together.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2ad63010014eaeefa4731cedbfbf1fef76cfb66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025=kz+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" /> for some positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/0/550651794687dd31f8012b39eeb32780dea8f26c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kz=2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e927f35ddc2b78708bc21b690940ff694a0da465.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$kz=2^3\\times{11}\\times{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nIn the end, do not forget that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd3d68e77a39e1ea97e7009f70e12622fa76835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> is not included. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74a6b2f07cb10edfe0d032e16f6e5f6347f2b7c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4320-1=4319$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>~G2JFForever\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZF9ZRQBPsSg?si=h0WR-pXaIc8_MAJs\">2025 AMC 12 B #23</a>\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathproblemsolvingskills.wordpress.com/\">MathProblemSolvingSkills.com</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_by_OmegaLearn.org\">Video Solution 2 by OmegaLearn.org</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.